{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:07 2026-10-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:07 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:07 2026-10-12 HKT</p><p>元朗米埔發現屍體。周日（11日）晚上10時許，一名內地女子向本港友人求助，指其30多歲的丈夫在担竿洲路一帶失去聯絡，友人遂向警方報案。</p><p>救援人員接報到場搜索，其後在担竿洲路一魚塘發現失蹤男子，消防員將他救起，但事主已當場死亡。警方調查後相信死者是一名內地黑工，拘捕一名男僱主。</p><img alt=\"警方在現場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7667f98f0e984766fa02c18240076ded/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男子遺體由帳篷遮蔽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d9c393dbac892778c27613ded5a0d4c1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_08_44.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/22301dd7d5aaa086c4b76498e823822e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_22_50_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a505b025582d33d574d35898a0fc8b1c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_22_50.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/51c05059e86572e447ca7b943bc88d6a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_08_43.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男子倒斃魚塘，警方用帳篷遮蔽遺體。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f6218731928e1f2dfd84a1f83a3fdbab/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_13.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/335133d4a42ba78e5b4c1e8b71c9dba9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0663a0515e24a7d54d3facfd3cf1d940/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_22_50_2_.jpeg\"/><p>據了解，死者被發現倒斃魚塘時，全身赤裸，其後鑑證科人員亦到場搜證。現場消息稱，人員檢查遺體後，初步相信案件無可疑，暫將案件列作屍體發現，交由邊境警區重案組跟進。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/576efa09414f12b57b7569395c5df3d4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_22_42.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d3dd9a259a745f3a3118e4d4d1e876b7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_22_41.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是担竿洲路。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/fc791fa093acf767af7badbaef98069a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5e149c5a16a380e0fad0b6e2eaf2eb44/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_11_51.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"人員在魚塘範圍調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/30698a8a9b69dbc5088591c302219760/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/566f89ab5c1a44a3db49b57815d3e763/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_11.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2a3720f1189ee179c914e480f50f12b3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_10_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/47436ed4d6b3085e4bd01f4efbdbbe51/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_09_07_10.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T01:58:24.365554+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}